<title>GERMANY: Henkel to get 1.3 bln DM for Degussa.</title>
<headline>Henkel to get 1.3 bln DM for Degussa.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group Henkel KGaA said it would receive 1.3 billion marks for the sale of its 16.1 percent stake in Degussa to utilities group Veba AG.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
</text>
